      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{632a1f5ab98aa644af84dab3|full_name}:  I see how it functions on the website, if I could throw in a suggestion. It would be really nice to have two separate \"published\" and \"private\" tabs in vrc.\nBack on the old menu, I would never go to the \"mine\" list unless I specifically had a private world I was working on, otherwise I would check my worlds through my social profile. \nHaving two separate tabs for managing and observing successful published worlds, and a separate tab for all the junk, test, and in progress builds would make things way easier to track and manage. \nSome people even have over 100 unlisted worlds.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
