  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-08T03:00:54.997Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As a world creator, I have 37 created worlds, only 12 are published. In this new world menu all my worlds are combined, this makes looking through my relevant worlds much harder and unpleasant. For example, my most popular world which was at the front of my profile, is now here.",
